ase. Thoughtfully designed with three full bathrooms, including a spa-inspired five-piece primary ensuite and a four-piece secondary ensuite, the layout balances privacy with open, light-filled living. A dedicated office, pantry, in-suite laundry, and storage complete the suite, along with two titled parking stalls.Residents enjoy an exceptional suite of amenities: pool, hot tub, steam room, fitness centre, billiards lounge, conference space, rooftop patio with BBQs, pet walk, and 24-hour concierge service. Monthly fees include heat, water, and full access to amenities. With direct Pedway access to Rogers Place, LRT, dining, and shopping, this is elevated urban living - effortless, connected, and unmistakably luxurious. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$1,095,000"],["Type","Condo"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Living area","1,578 sq ft"],["Year built","2017"],["Condo fee","$2,116 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Downtown"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5K0K6"],["MLS® number","E4470591"],["Listed","January 20, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave, Oven - Built-In, Hood Fan"],["Heating","Coil Fan"],["Parking","Underground, Parkade, Stall"],["Condo fee includes","Exterior Maintenance, Property Management, Security, Heat, Water, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.20 m × 4.69 m (17'1\" × 15'5\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.30 m × 3.19 m (10'10\" × 10'6\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.64 m × 5.09 m (15'3\" × 16'8\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","5.47 m × 3.03 m (17'11\" × 9'11\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","2.64 m × 5.64 m (8'8\" × 18'6\")"],["Laundry room","Main level","2.71 m × 1.59 m (8'11\" × 5'3\")"],["Office","Main level","3.18 m × 4.19 m (10'5\" × 13'9\")"],["Storage","Main level","2.80 m × 2.22 m (9'2\" × 7'3\")"]],"courtesy":"Ron Dickson, Sotheby's International Realty Canada and Ryan Debler, Sotheby's International Realty Canada","board":"REALTORS® Association of E